{
  "lecture_id": "lecture-08",
  "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "小卷积核让相距很远的区域在浅层中不能直接交互；注意力允许根据任务动态汇聚远处 token 的信息。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 4
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 5
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "token 是封装信息的向量。图像可切成 patches，再用可学习线性投影映射为 d 维 token；N 个 token 组成矩阵 T∈R^{N×d}。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 11
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 14
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "跨 token 的线性组合对整条 token 向量使用同一个标量权重；矩阵形式是 T_out=W T_in。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "同一个非线性函数 F_θ 独立作用于每个 token；通常由 MLP 实现，功能上类似沿 token 序列运行的 1×1 卷积。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 18
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "query 表示要寻找什么，key 用于匹配，value 是被汇聚的内容。先由线性投影得到 q、k、v，再把 query 与各 key 的相似度经 softmax 归一化，最后对 value 加权求和。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 29
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 32
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "self-attention 让同一组输入 token 同时提供 queries、keys 与 values，使每个 token 能根据上下文聚合其他 token。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 30
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 32
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "k 个 head 各自拥有 Q/K/V 投影并行计算，按 token 位置拼接结果，再以 W_MSA 投影回 d 维。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 37
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ViT 块把 token norm、MSA、残差连接、再次 token norm、逐 token MLP 与另一条残差连接组合起来，并重复 L 次。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 38
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 39
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "不含位置码的逐 token 层和自注意力对输入 token 的置换作同样置换，因此整个 transformer 是 set-to-set 的置换等变映射，而不是自动感知空间位置。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 35
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 41
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "把坐标在多频率正弦基上编码，并把位置向量加入或拼接到 token 表示，从而让模型区分位置。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 43
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 44
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "因果 mask 阻止位置 i 使用未来位置；训练时，多个 next-token 预测可在一次前向传播中并行监督，多层仍保持因果依赖。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 48
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 51
        },
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 52
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "图像到文本架构先以图像 self-attention 得到视觉 token；文本解码器用 causal self-attention，并让文本 token cross-attend 图像 token。",
      "anchors": [
        {
          "pdf_sha256": "e72290651ce5c112b09e5ee0068a7b270d26ffe262e8fa7ff131fabeda4e78ca",
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-08-slides",
          "page": 54
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
